    {
      "kind": "Page",
      "id": "operations",
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Operations handbook"
      },
      "spec": {
        "body": "Runbooks for the recurring operations of the Alizé landscape. Each runbook says when to use it, the steps, and how to check the result.\n\n## Runbooks\n\n- [[page:replay-nightly-import]]: when Billing did not receive the customers from the CRM.\n- [[page:month-end-closing]]: the checks before Accounting closes the month.\n\nKeep a runbook next to the record it is about: attach it to the flow or the application, so that it shows on that record.",
        "order": 1,
        "ownerTeamId": "team-platform",
        "tags": [
          "runbook"
        ],
        "visibility": "everyone"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "Page",
      "id": "replay-nightly-import",
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Replay the nightly customer import"
      },
      "spec": {
        "body": "Use this runbook when [[flow:crm-to-billing-customers]] did not run, or ran with an empty file, and Billing must invoice before the morning.\n\n## Symptoms\n\n- The invoice run of [[application:billing|Billing]] stops with *\"No customer delta for today\"*.\n- The file `customers-YYYYMMDD.csv` is missing from the inbound folder of [[application:sftp|the file exchange]].\n\n## Steps\n\n1. Check that the CRM export finished: in [[application:crm]], open *Jobs → Nightly customer extract* and look for today's run.\n2. If the export failed, start it again with *Run now*. It takes about ten minutes for 15,000 lines.\n3. Check that the new file is on the file exchange, under `/inbound/billing/`.\n4. In Billing, start *Import customers* by hand, then the invoice run.\n\n## Checks\n\n- The import log shows the number of lines read and rejected. More than 1% rejected: stop and call Team CRM.\n- Every [[dataObject:customer]] invoiced today has a billing account.\n\n## Why a file?\n\nSee [[page:adr-nightly-file]]. The move to the Billing 4.3 API is planned in [[page:billing-api-v4-cutover]].",
        "parentId": "operations",
        "order": 1,
        "attachedTo": {
          "kind": "flow",
          "id": "crm-to-billing-customers"
        },
        "tags": [
          "runbook",
          "billing",
          "crm"
        ],
        "visibility": "everyone"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "Page",
      "id": "month-end-closing",
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Month-end closing checklist"
      },
      "spec": {
        "body": "Checks to run with Team Finance before [[application:acct]] closes the month.\n\n1. [[flow:billing-acct]] delivered the ledger entries of the month (1st of the month, after the last invoice run).\n2. [[flow:payments-acct]] delivered the cash entries of the last day.\n3. The totals of invoices and ledger entries match. A gap usually means a credit note issued after the export.\n4. Team Payments confirmed the bank reconciliation.\n\nBackground on the domain: [[page:finance-overview]].",
        "parentId": "operations",
        "order": 2,
        "attachedTo": {
          "kind": "application",
          "id": "acct"
        },
        "tags": [
          "runbook",
          "finance"
        ],
        "visibility": "everyone"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "Page",
